# cw134, the name remembered (Docs/Design/84). Exported from ridgemere3 at revision 1: edit it in Atlas or the DM, or as a draft through tools/mantle_load.py.
mantle cw134
revision 1
state ready
dialect coldwater
accent light broad
tier standard
written_for tn_lf_flint_downcombe
written_by claude-codex-cw-2
title the name remembered
fits stage=adult|old
prefers talk=chatty
traits temper=even talk=chatty warmth=reserved humour=merry honesty=frank piety=ordinary drive=steady
quirk repeats_new_names_while_stirring_soap
likes roast_pork swimming new_boots misty_dawns
dislikes bad_manners flies
fears forgetting_a_name_at_a_funeral lye_splashing_a_new_hand
hopes steady_work_for_the_whole_house a_clean_swim_after_a_hot_shift
topics work +0.5 family +0.3 pastimes +0.4 food +0.3 gossip -0.3
styles comfort=direct gossip=careful refuse=blunt tease=playful
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# remembers each #name# spoken across the #vat#, checks the #lye# before a shift, and keeps clean #boots# for the walk #home#.

words
oath! = Lye and lake | By the clean bar
saying! = Names sink deeper than the ladle | Test the vat before you stir
name = name | given name
names = names | given names
soap = soap | clean bar
bar = bar | soap bar
bars = bars | soap bars
lye = lye | caustic lye
vat = vat | boiling vat
vats = vats | boiling vats
pot = pot | boiling pot
fire = fire | low fire
ash = ash | potash
oil = oil | rendered fat
ladle = ladle | long ladle
stir = stir | stir steadily
batch = batch | soap batch
mould = mould | soap mould
moulds = moulds | soap moulds
shelf = shelf | drying shelf
shelves = shelves | drying shelves
water = water | clear water
lake = lake | Glasswater
shore = shore | lake shore
swim = swim | lake swim
mist = mist | dawn mist
dawn = dawn | early morning
boots = boots | new boots
boot = boot | work boot
floor = floor | boiling-house floor
music = music | dance tune
lesson = lesson | first lesson
pair = pair | matched pair
pork = pork | roast pork
crackling = crackling | crisp crackling
supper = supper | evening meal
flies = flies | biting flies
manners = manners | courtesy
market = market | market square
bread = bread | loaf
price = price | asking price
coin = coin | penny
road = road | High Road
city = city | Ridgemere
house = house | cottage
home = home | own hearth
hand = hand | working hand
hands = hands | working hands
scar = scar | old scar

any
opinion @1 city against 1 : The #city# makes a person repeat a #name# three times. | I would sooner work beside people who know which #vat# is hot.
opinion @1 drink for 1 : A cup with the crew after a clean #batch# is fair reward. | I keep my head clear near the #lye#.
opinion @1 festivals for 3 : I danced at my wedding until my #boots# wore through. | A feast with #pork# and music deserves a full day.
opinion @1 houses against 1 : They can afford another #hand# yet leave the bench empty. | I have seen their #soap# bought and their workers ignored.
opinion @1 merchants against 3 : A #bread# seller sees a full #vat# and assumes I have extra #coin#. | I ask them to show what changed before raising the #price#.
opinion @1 newcomers against 1 : I will teach a new #hand# the #lye# rules, but I fear losing hours to them. | A careless stranger near a #vat# puts us all at risk.
opinion @1 times against 1 : The #shelves# hold plenty of #soap#, yet supper gets dearer. | Each week my #coin# seems smaller at the #market#.
opinion @1 strangers mixed 0 : I remember a stranger's #name# after one meeting. | That does not mean I hand over the #ladle#.

grown
line @1 greet : #greet#. I know your #name#; it will come back while I stir. | #greet#. Keep back from the hot #vat#.
line @2 greet [self.working=yes] : Speak up while the #pot# boils. | I can answer after this #batch# is stirred.
line @3 greet [pair.band=friends|family] : I knew your step before I saw you. | Come by the cool #shelf# where we can talk.
line @4 greet [here.time=dawn] : The #mist# arrived before the #fire# was lit. | #greet#. My #boots# are still dry.
line @1 greet.return : I have your #name# this time. | #welcome_back#. The #bars# are set to dry.
line @1 kin.open [pair.kin!=no] : Come in; supper will be ready soon. | Put those #boots# beside mine.
line @1 again.open : We were naming the workers from that #batch#. | Did you remember the question you meant to ask?
line @1 farewell : #farewell#. Keep clear of the #lye#. | #saying.capitalize#. I have to turn these #bars#.
line @1 farewell.return : I will save a fresh #bar# for your return. | The #lake# is good for a swim after work.
line @1 react.news : Name who saw it and I will listen. | I can set the #ladle# down.
line @1 react.news.new : Nobody has brought that report to the #pot#. | Was the person from the #market#?
line @1 react.news.known : I recognize part of that account. | The #name# you gave is new to me in this matter.
line @1 react.news.doubt : #hedge#, a remembered #name# is not proof by itself. | I want to hear from the person who was there.
line @1 react.news.sorrow [topic.kind=death|loss|theft|assault|arrest|crime] : That is a loss. The #name# will stay with me. | Sit where the #fire# cannot trouble you.
line @1 react.news.glad [topic.kind=marriage|birth|apprentice|succession|work] : That calls for a feast and clean #boots#. | Good; let me remember the day as well as the #name#.
line @1 answer.how : The #batch# set well and I am content. | I would like a #swim# after this shift.
line @1 answer.how.busy [self.working=yes] : I am stirring #lye# and watching the #fire#. | There are #bars# to turn on the #shelf#.
line @1 ask.how : Have your #hands# had a rest? | How is supper at your #home#?
line @1 sympathise : I can listen without telling the whole #house#. | Speak plainly; I will stay.
line @1 reassure : A poor #batch# can be made again. | We will check the #vat# before anyone is hurt.
line @1 decline : No. The #lye# cannot be left to boil alone. | I will not pretend that #price# is fair.
line @1 accept_decline : Then I shall leave it there. | I heard your answer.
line @1 thank : You caught the spill before it reached the #shelf#. | I appreciate the extra #hand# at the #vat#.
line @1 deflect_thanks : The #bar# was already cut. | I only remembered where the #ladle# had gone.
line @1 preclose : The #fire# needs banking. | I have to check the last #mould#.
line @1 tease [pair.band=friends] : I remember your #name# better than you remember mine. | Your #boots# look too fine for this #floor#.
line @1 ack : #bc_right#. I shall lower the #fire#. | #bc_fair_enough#. The #bars# can wait.
line @1 give.advice : Wash a splash of #lye# at once. | Let a new #bar# dry before wrapping it.
line @1 warn [world.bandits=near] : The #road# has thieves near the bend. | Keep your #coin# out of view after dusk.
scene remembered_names
when topic=pastimes
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : A #name# stays with me after the face has gone. | I can list the workers who stood by this #vat# years ago.
b : Does that help? | Have you ever forgotten one?
a : At a crowded #market#, it does. | A surname, once; I asked again.

scene names_across_vat
when topic=work
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : I call each #hand# by #name# before moving the #lye#. | It is safer when everyone knows who holds the #ladle#.
b : Do they answer? | Does that prevent mistakes?
a : Loud enough over the #pot#. | It has so far.

scene scar_lesson
when topic=work
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : This old #scar# reminds me to leave room around a boiling #vat#. | I stepped too near a swinging #ladle# once.
b : Was the burn serious? | Do you warn new workers?
a : It healed. | On their first morning.

scene lye_test
when topic=work
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : I test the #lye# before mixing it with #oil#. | A rushed #batch# can bite the #hands# that use it.
b : How do you test it? | Can it be saved?
a : By the old measure and a steady eye. | Before it sets, sometimes.

scene slow_fire
when topic=work
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : A low #fire# keeps the #pot# from surging. | I would rather wait than scrub a boilover from the #floor#.
b : How long do you stir? | Does it happen often?
a : Until the mixture thickens. | Only when someone is impatient.

scene mould_rows
when topic=work
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : I lay the #moulds# in straight rows on the #shelf#. | Each #bar# needs air around its edge.
b : Do they all set alike? | How soon can you sell them?
a : Not quite. | Once they have dried enough.

scene drying_shelf
when topic=work
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : A damp #shelf# spoils good #soap# slowly. | I turn the #bars# so no side stays wet.
b : Can you tell when one is ready? | Do you cover them?
a : By its weight. | Only from dust.

scene flies_at_pot
when topic=weather here.season=summer
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : #flies.capitalize# find the warm #pot# as soon as summer begins. | I keep the #moulds# covered while the door is open.
b : Can you drive them out? | Do they spoil the soap?
a : With a screen and patience. | If they reach a fresh #bar#.

scene misty_dawn
when topic=weather
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : A misty #dawn# makes the #lake# look closer to the #house#. | I can find the #road# by the smell of the #fire# starting.
b : Do you like the mist? | Does it delay you?
a : Before the #pot# heats, yes. | Only if the path is wet.

scene lake_swim
when topic=pastimes
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : After a shift steeped in #lye# smell, I take a #swim#. | Cold #water# leaves the heat of the #pot# behind.
b : Is it very cold? | Do you swim alone?
a : Enough to wake me. | Sometimes with a friend.

scene clean_shore
when topic=pastimes
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : I leave my #boots# well above the #shore# before swimming. | A dry #pair# makes the return walk pleasant.
b : Have they been washed away? | Why new boots?
a : Never; I place them carefully. | The old soles split at the #vat#.

scene roast_pork
when topic=food
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : Roast #pork# with sharp #crackling# is worth waiting for after a shift. | I eat before the smell of #soap# returns to my head.
b : Do you cook it? | Does your house share supper?
a : When I have a free evening. | We pull out another chair for visitors.

scene wedding_dance
when topic=memories
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : I danced hard enough at my wedding to wear through a #boot#. | The #music# lasted after the lamps burned low.
b : Did you notice then? | Would you dance that hard again?
a : The next morning. | With a sturdier #pair#.

scene spouse_supper
when topic=family self.married=yes
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : My #self.spouse# knows when a #batch# has gone badly by my silence. | At supper I try to leave the #vat# behind.
b : Do you talk it over? | Does that help?
a : Once I have eaten. | More than another hour at work.

scene mother_name
when topic=family
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : My #self.mother# taught me to ask a person's #name# before asking about work. | I have kept the habit in the boiling #house#.
b : Did she remember names too? | Do people mind?
a : Better than I do. | Most are glad.

scene bread_price
when topic=prices
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : I see #bread# grow dearer while the #soap# is sold by the same #bar#. | The #market# seller has a reason ready, every week.
b : Do you believe it? | Can you change your price?
a : I listen, then count my #coin#. | That is for the boss to decide.

scene new_hand
when topic=work
does tell.self / react.self / assess
a : I show a new #hand# where the clean #water# is kept. | The first #lesson# is how to step away from a #vat#.
b : Do they learn quickly? | Is the job dangerous?
a : Some do. | Only if we rush.

story name_at_market [topic=memories self.age>=25]
  : Someone spoke to me at the #market# after years away.
  : I gave the right #name# before I found the right face in memory.
  ask : Were they surprised?
  b : That is a useful gift.
  : They laughed, and then I remembered their whole family.

story boiling_spill [topic=work self.age>=25]
  : The #pot# rose too fast while I carried a fresh #mould#.
  : I stepped back before the #lye# crossed the #floor#.
  ask : Did anyone get hurt?
  b : A quick step matters there.
  : No. We lowered the #fire# and started the #batch# again.

story boot_at_wedding [topic=memories self.age>=25]
  : My wedding #music# carried on well past supper.
  : The sole of one #boot# opened during the last dance.
  ask : Did you stop dancing?
  b : A new pair sounds deserved.
  : After that tune. I still keep better #boots# for festivals.

rule @bark_names
when concept=bark
does aside
cooldown 8h
say I know that #name# from somewhere. | A face returns when I say the #name# aloud.

rule @bark_vat
when concept=bark self.working=yes
does aside
cooldown 7h
say Keep a #hand# clear of the #vat#. | The #lye# wants another check.

rule @bark_boots
when concept=bark
does aside
cooldown 10h
say These #boots# still hold the road well. | I should scrape the #floor# before leaving.

rule @bark_swim
when concept=bark here.time=dusk
does aside
cooldown 11h
say The #lake# might clear my head tonight. | One #swim# after this #batch#.

dlg @1 resident.hub : #greet#. Keep back from the #vat# while we speak. | #greet#. Your #name# is coming to me.
dlg @2 resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : I knew I remembered you; the #bars# have dried since. | Back again? The #pot# is cool now.
dlg @1 resident.job : I help make #soap# at #self.workplace#, from the #pot# to the #moulds#. | I mind the #lye#, stir the #vat#, and turn the drying #bars#.
dlg @1 resident.bye : #farewell#. Mind the hot #pot# on your way. | #saying.capitalize#. I must finish this #batch#.
graft resident.hub
choice Do you really remember every name? -> names
node names
say Most of them. Say yours once and I will try to keep it, even over the noise of the #pot#.
free
choice Where do you swim? -> lake
choice Back to the soap. -> hub
node lake
say At a clear place along the #shore#, after I have washed the #lye# from my #hands#.
choice Back to the soap. -> hub
choice Goodbye. -> bye
